       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 30-238
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678677"
    >
Satisfaction of judgments.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678677" data-guid="7678677"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678677" data-guid="7678677" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678677_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Judgments rendered and docketed in this Court may be satisfied in the same manner as judgments rendered and docketed in courts of record.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

